---
layout: base.njk
title: "Journal"
description: "Direct dispatches from the &go&co founders."
nav: journal
permalink: /journal/index.html
---
<div class="page-hero wrap reveal">
  <span class="eyebrow">Journal</span>
  <h1>From the founders — direct dispatches.</h1>
  <p>No corporate insights, no ghostwriting — Tom, Dan, and Jordan write these themselves, when they have something worth saying.</p>
</div>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    {% if collections.journal.length %}
    <div class="journal-list">
      {% for post in collections.journal %}
      <a class="journal-row" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="journal-row-main">
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.teaser }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journal-row-meta">
          {{ post.data.date | postDate }}<br>{{ post.data.author }}
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="journal-empty">Nothing published yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
